From: Tommi <tommi@webrtc.org>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 15:50:16 +0200
Subject: (cherry-pick-branch-heads/8103) [M157] Keep unchanged video decoders
 across SetDecoders()

Original change's description:
> Keep unchanged video decoders across SetDecoders()
>
> Updating the receive codecs, e.g. when the receiving side creates a new
> offer, deregistered all decoders and reset the decoder database. The
> decoder in use was then recreated and needed a keyframe even if its
> configuration hadn't changed, and a keyframe was always requested.
>
> Apply only the difference between the old and new decoders instead.
> Removed or updated decoders are deregistered, added or updated ones are
> registered and unchanged decoders, including the one in use, keep
> running. A keyframe is now only requested if the decoder in use was
> removed or replaced.
>
> Fixed: chromium:572220780
